@startuml
title Farm Management System State Machine

[*] --> LoggedOut

state LoggedOut
state LoggedIn
state MarketConditions
state PestControlHelp
state SoilSuggestions
state WeatherInsights
state LabourAvailability

LoggedOut --> LoggedIn : login

LoggedIn --> MarketConditions : select market conditions
LoggedIn --> PestControlHelp : select pest control help
LoggedIn --> SoilSuggestions : select soil suggestions
LoggedIn --> WeatherInsights : select weather insights
LoggedIn --> LabourAvailability : select labour availability

MarketConditions --> LoggedIn : return to main area
PestControlHelp --> LoggedIn : return to main area
SoilSuggestions --> LoggedIn : return to main area
WeatherInsights --> LoggedIn : return to main area
LabourAvailability --> LoggedIn : return to main area

LoggedIn --> LoggedOut : logout

@enduml
